mo codes). If you never open a sender’s messages after a month, delete and unsubscribe.\n\n- Delete after use: single-use notifications (password resets, delivery confirmations) once you’ve acted on them and there’s no need for a record.\n\n- Tuck (archive/label): receipts, invoices, warranty info, contracts, tax or legal records, or anything you might need to search for later. Keep these for the required retention period.\n\n- Tuck: ongoing threads or projects you may revisit — archive and add a project label so they’re findable without cluttering the inbox.\n\n- Delete: duplicate or low-value newsletters you don’t read. If you might want similar content later, unsubscribe and delete now; if you want to keep occasional issues, tuck.\n\n- Tuck (sentimental): personal notes you want to keep but don’t need in your inbox — put them in a “Memories” label.\n\n- When unsure: ask “Will I need this within 90 days or is it legally/financially important?” If no → delete. If yes → tuck.\n\nQuick note on terms: archiving/tucking keeps messages searchable and recoverable; deleting removes them (may be permanent depending on your provider). I won’t delete or archive anything for you unless you ask and give explicit confirmation about which messages.","type":"output_text"}],"id":"msg_0527bbbef5af5efe016a9a6fb46e7c87d0bc920649e4cb7ec9","role":"assistant","status":"completed","type":"message"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"presence_penalty":0.0,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt_cache_key":null,"prompt_cache_retention":"in_memory","reasoning":{"context":"current_turn","effort":"medium","mode":"standard","summary":null},"safety_identifier":null,"service_tier":"default","status":"completed","store":false,"temperature":1.0,"text":{"format":{"type":"text"},"verbosity":"medium"},"tool_choice":"auto","tool_usage":{"image_gen":{"input_tokens":0,"input_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"total_token